# epub — no standalone package
# Classification: FORMAT_CAPABILITY_OF_OTHER_PRODUCT
# Sprint: lowcode-systemization-pass3-20260530

No Aspose.Epub NuGet package exists. EPUB is a format supported by:
- Aspose.Words (SaveFormat.Epub, covered by words LowCode family)
- Aspose.HTML (epub reading/conversion, no LowCode namespace)
